# {{ project_name }} Display Pane Plugin

This element contains the modern frontend plugin for {{ project_name }}.

## Development

Run `pnpm install` or `python addon.py bootstrap --dir <element-folder>` from the project root to install frontend dependencies and fetch the SDK for your target Seeq server.

Useful commands inside the plugin folder:

- `pnpm build`
- `pnpm test`
- `pnpm lint`
- `pnpm deploy`

From the project root, you can use `python addon.py build`, `python addon.py deploy`, and `python addon.py watch` to work with the full add-on package.
